{"task_id": "Mbpp/7", "solution": "def find_char_long(input_string: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds all words in a string that are at least 4 characters long.\n    Splits the string by whitespace and filters words based on their length.\n    \"\"\"\n    words = input_string.split()\n    long_words = [word for word in words if len(word) >= 4]\n    return long_words"}
