{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts substrings where the sum of digit characters equals the substring length.\n    Delegates to helper functions for generation, calculation, and validation.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            substring = s[i : j + 1]\n            \n            # Helper: _calculate_digit_sum\n            current_sum = 0\n            for char_digit in substring:\n                current_sum += int(char_digit)\n            \n            # Helper: _is_valid_substring (combines with _calculate_digit_sum)\n            if current_sum == len(substring):\n                count += 1\n                \n    return count"}
