{"task_id": "Mbpp/100", "solution": "def next_smallest_palindrome(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Find the next smallest palindrome greater than the input integer.\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_palindrome(num: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Check if a number is a palindrome.\"\"\"\n        s = str(num)\n        return s == s[::-1]\n\n    def _increment_to_palindrome(start_num: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculate the next palindrome greater than start_num.\"\"\"\n        candidate = start_num + 1\n        while True:\n            if _is_palindrome(candidate):\n                return candidate\n            candidate += 1\n\n    return _increment_to_palindrome(n)"}
