{"task_id": "Mbpp/108", "solution": "def merge_sorted_list(list1, list2, list3):\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges three input lists into a single list and sorts it in ascending order.\n    Duplicate values are preserved in the final sorted list.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _merge_lists(lists_to_merge):\n        \"\"\"Combines multiple lists into a single list.\"\"\"\n        combined_list = []\n        for lst in lists_to_merge:\n            combined_list.extend(lst)\n        return combined_list\n\n    def _sort_merged_list(merged_list):\n        \"\"\"Sorts the merged list in ascending order.\"\"\"\n        merged_list.sort()\n        return merged_list\n\n    merged = _merge_lists([list1, list2, list3])\n    sorted_result = _sort_merged_list(merged)\n    return sorted_result"}
