{"task_id": "Mbpp/133", "solution": "def sum_negativenum(numbers: list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the negative numbers in a given list.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _filter_negatives(nums: list) -> list:\n        \"\"\"\n        Filters a list to return only negative numbers.\n        \"\"\"\n        return [num for num in nums if num < 0]\n\n    def _calculate_sum(nums: list) -> (int or float):\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the sum of a list of numbers.\n        \"\"\"\n        return sum(nums)\n\n    filtered_negatives = _filter_negatives(numbers)\n    total_sum = _calculate_sum(filtered_negatives)\n    return total_sum"}
