{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def _validate_input_lists(list1: list, list2: list, list3: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Validates that all input lists have equal length.\"\"\"\n    return len(list1) == len(list2) == len(list3)\n\ndef _create_nested_dict(outer_key, inner_key, value) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Creates a single nested dictionary from three elements.\"\"\"\n    return {outer_key: {inner_key: value}}\n\ndef convert_list_dictionary(list1: list, list2: list, list3: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts three input lists to a list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each element from list1 becomes an outer key, list2 an inner key, and list3 an inner value.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not _validate_input_lists(list1, list2, list3):\n        return []\n\n    result = []\n    for outer_key, inner_key, value in zip(list1, list2, list3):\n        nested_dict = _create_nested_dict(outer_key, inner_key, value)\n        result.append(nested_dict)\n    return result"}
