{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += i ** 3\n    \n    if n == 0:\n        return 0.0 # Or handle as an error, but for natural numbers, n is usually >= 1.\n                   # Given the context, we assume n is a positive integer.\n    \n    return float(sum_of_cubes) / n"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def _calculate_even_number(position: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the even number at a given 1-indexed position.\"\"\"\n    return 2 * position\n\ndef _calculate_cube(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the cube of a given number.\"\"\"\n    return number ** 3\n\ndef cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n even natural numbers.\n    For n=2, it sums (2^3) + (4^3) = 8 + 64 = 72.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_num = _calculate_even_number(i)\n        cube_val = _calculate_cube(even_num)\n        total_sum += cube_val\n    return total_sum"}
