{"task_id": "Mbpp/459", "solution": "def remove_uppercase(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes all contiguous sequences of uppercase letters from the input string.\n    Preserves lowercase letters and non-alphabetic characters.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result_chars = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(input_string):\n        char = input_string[i]\n        if 'A' <= char <= 'Z':  # Check if character is uppercase\n            # If it's an uppercase character, skip the entire sequence\n            while i < len(input_string) and 'A' <= input_string[i] <= 'Z':\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            # If it's not uppercase, append it to the result\n            result_chars.append(char)\n            i += 1\n            \n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
