{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    Handles zero and single-digit numbers correctly.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    while number > 0:\n        digit = number % 10\n        total_sum += digit\n        number //= 10\n    return total_sum"}
