{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(array, value):\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the right insertion point for a specified value in sorted order using binary search.\n    This function returns the index where the value should be inserted to maintain sorted order,\n    ensuring it's placed after any existing duplicates.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] <= value:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
